OL,3,GNEWSAResidents can nominate street for
OL,4,Acleaning trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents in Sheffield are being
OL,7,Finvited to take part in a chemical-free
OL,8,Fstreet cleaning scheme.
OL,10,FThe City Council said it had heavily
OL,11,Freduced the amount glyphosate it had
OL,12,Fused in 2026 by using a mix of weed
OL,13,Ftreatments and street cleaning to
OL,14,Ftackle weeds.
OL,16,FThe authority said plans to continue
OL,17,Fthe approach had been approved and up
OL,18,Fto 20 streets can apply to take part in
OL,19,Fthe year-long trial in 2027.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
