OL,3,GNEWSAResidents can nominate street for
OL,4,Acleaning trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Mark Rusling, chairman of
OL,7,FSheffield's Environmental Services
OL,8,FCommittee, said residents wanted
OL,9,Fstreets clean and well-maintained but
OL,10,Fthere was also a strong desire to
OL,11,Freduce chemicals.
